				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "SRLs come in a resolved and unresolved form. Some resolve immediately, others resolve automatically when used. `SRLFile` currently resolves immediately to a fileReference `#file:#//`, but for some uses the unresolved resource locator `#file:/` provides more capabilities, a FileReference can't do this:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
