				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "**URLs - even better:**\nThe {{gtClass:SRLUrl}} Symbolic Resource Locator `#url://`, is handled by {{gtClass:TTSchemeRouter}} which  handles custom schemes. The native HttpClient ({{gtClass:ZnClient}}) is used in Pharo.\n\nSchemes that `TTSchemeRouter` does not handle are then put out to tender to {{gtClass:SRLRouter}} to find a handler.\n\nIn this example we end up with an {{gtClass:SRLUrl}} whose virtual httpClient is {{gtClass:SRLFile}}.\n\nSRLFile normally handles substitution of both named file origins, and environment variables."
			},
