				},
				"string" : "**Adding more SRLs**\nAdding more \"http\" schemes to {{gtClass:TTSchemeRouter}}, is as simple s adding additional SRL classes eg. {{gtClass:SRLJira}} {{gtClass:SRLSnow}} , {{gtClass:Wikipedia}} {{gtClass:ISBN}} "
